	<section_number>29.1-202</section_number>
	<catch_line>Ex officio conservation police officers</catch_line>
	<text>
		All sheriffs, police officers or other peace officers of this Commonwealth shall be ex officio conservation police officers.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 29-29; 1987, c. 488.</history>
</law>
